{
    "title": "Chess Events: Games & Results",
    "description": "Stay up to date with top chess tournaments and events from around the world. Chess.com's Events app offers a dynamic hub for following live tournaments and events, keeping you at the forefront of the competitive chess scene. Witness the world's top grandmasters battle it out in prestigious events like the World Chess Championship, the Champions Chess Tour, or any other major chess event.\r\n\r\nStay on Top of the Action:\r\n-Watch games live: keep up with every move played by your favorite players as they battle to reach the top. All while enjoying a live analysis of the game by the strongest chess engine in the world.\r\n-Live standings and past rounds results: never miss a beat! Track the current tournament leaderboard in real-time. See detailed results from previous rounds and analyze any player's performance throughout the event.\r\n-Global search and events calendar: find current and upcoming top tournaments to enjoy. You can also search for past events to see their results. \r\n-Tournament info: find all relevant information about major chess events like format, prizes, players, playing schedule, and more.\r\n-Community chat: the excitement doesn't stop at the board. Join the vibrant chess community and discuss the games with fellow enthusiasts during live streams.\r\n-Live streaming: follow the live coverage of all the top chess tournaments right from you phone.\r\n\r\nPlayers info: \r\nCheck the recent activity and career breakdown of the top players, as well as their live ranking and ratings.\r\n\r\nEnhanced Viewing Experience:\r\n-Game analysis: go beyond the final result. Chess.com offers in-depth analysis for every game, allowing you to dissect the key moments, understand strategic choices, and learn from the moves of the masters.\r\n-Download and Share: don't just watch, learn and grow! Download the PGN (Portable Game Notation) files of the games to analyze them later or share them with friends to discuss and improve your chess skills together.\r\n\r\nDownload the app now and never miss a second of the thrilling world of chess events! \r\n\r\nABOUT CHESS.COM:\r\nChess.com is created by chess players and people who love chess!\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.chess.com/legal/user-agreement\r\nTeam: http://www.chess.com/about\r\nFacebook: http://www.facebook.com/chess\r\nTwitter: http://twitter.com/chesscom\r\nYouTube: http://www.youtube.com/wwwchesscom\r\nTwitchTV: http://www.twitch.com/chess\r\nChess events: https://www.chess.com/events",
